    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="classcuda_1_1experimental_1_1device__memory__pool" kindref="compound">device_memory_pool</ref></computeroutput> is an owning wrapper around a <ulink url="https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-runtime-api/group__CUDART__MEMORY__POOLS.html">cudaMemPool_t</ulink>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It handles creation and destruction of the underlying pool utilizing the provided <computeroutput><ref refid="structcuda_1_1experimental_1_1memory__pool__properties" kindref="compound">memory_pool_properties</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
